# WebChat SOA - Trivy Vulnerability Ignore List
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN (one per line)
#
# Each entry MUST document:
# 1. Package / component
# 2. Risk assessment & reason for deferral
# 3. Tracking upstream issue or bug report
# 4. Expiration / review date
#
# Note: Base image unfixed CVEs are filtered via --ignore-unfixed.
# Patched OS packages are upgraded via Dockerfile apt-get upgrade.
# Keep this file empty unless an unpatchable fixed CVE emerges.
